# diffnav — git diff pager with a file tree (à la GitHub)

## Pipe a diff in
    git diff | diffnav                      # working tree diff
    git diff --staged | diffnav              # staged diff
    gh pr diff <pr-url-or-number> | diffnav  # a PR's diff

## Set as git's diff pager
    git config --global pager.diff diffnav
    # gh-dash: set `pager: diff: diffnav` in gh-dash's config.yml (dash's `d` key uses it)

## View flags
    -s / --side-by-side       # force side-by-side view
    -u / --unified            # force unified view

## Watch mode
    diffnav --watch                                              # re-run `git diff` every 2s
    diffnav --watch --watch-cmd "git diff HEAD" --watch-interval 5s

## Requires
    delta installed (diffnav is delta + a file tree)
    A Nerd Font for icons to render — brew install --cask font-<name>-nerd-font
